#tr.en: he knows nothing of @varh[t3205.v10]{@fsux{eša} flour nor prayers } @vart[t3205.v11,t3205.v10]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} flour and the offering of prayers }. The evil @fsux{namtar} demon and the distressing @fsux{asag} demon @varh[t3205.v12]{have not carried him off (?) } @vart[t3205.v13,t3205.v12]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} do not approach him }. Who …… a divine oath is committing sacrilege, yet his troops are in good health.
#lem: lu[person]; mu[name]; diŋir[deity]; sal[thin]; niŋgig[that which is bad]; gu[eat]; ugnim[army]; silim[healthy]
#etcsl: line-id=29

